WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.080 --> 00:00:01.940
A seedling in a pot.

2
00:00:01.990 --> 00:00:03.160
No water.

3
00:00:03.210 --> 00:00:05.410
It stays small and pale.

4
00:00:05.460 --> 00:00:08.330
Now it gets water, but
it's out in a storm.

5
00:00:08.380 --> 00:00:09.820
Still nothing.

6
00:00:09.870 --> 00:00:12.310
Water, shelter and sunlight.

7
00:00:12.360 --> 00:00:14.960
At last, it starts to grow tall.

8
00:00:15.010 --> 00:00:16.550
People aren't plants.

9
00:00:16.600 --> 00:00:20.740
So what does a person need before
they can grow into who they could be?

10
00:00:20.790 --> 00:00:23.860
In this mission, you'll
meet self-actualisation:

11
00:00:23.910 --> 00:00:26.480
becoming the best person you can be.

12
00:00:26.530 --> 00:00:28.930
You'll meet two humanistic psychologists,

13
00:00:28.980 --> 00:00:33.230
Rogers and Maslow, who each
asked what helps a person grow.

14
00:00:33.280 --> 00:00:37.050
And you'll decide whether
talent alone is ever enough.

15
00:00:37.100 --> 00:00:41.560
Your mission: work out what a person
needs before they can truly grow.
